# Perch: host Perch's own pages (Settings, New Tab, Memory, Routines, Import, Welcome) on chrome://perch-*. Hooks RegisterChromeWebUIConfigs and lets those pages reach perchd on loopback in IsWebUIAllowedToMakeNetworkRequests (their CSP allows nothing else).
